    "body": "## Problem\n\nDescribe the problem (concisely).\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n\n`nvim --clean -u repro.lua`\n```lua\nvim.o.timeoutlen = 0\nrequire('vim._core.ui2').enable({})\nvim.keymap.set('n', '<space>', '<nop>')\nvim.keymap.set('n', '<space><space>', '<nop>')\n```\n\ntype `<space>`, `\"showcmd\"` won't disappear\n\n<img width=\"546\" height=\"164\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/32ca7007-ba51-4c22-a8f6-361b5e895bdb\" />\n\n## Expected behavior\n`\"showcmd\"` disappear after `timeoutlen` (don't appear when `timeoutlen=0`)\n\n## System info\n\n- Nvim version (nvim -v): `v0.13.0-dev-1062 g6392cd85ee` neovim/neovim@6392cd85ee\n- Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?: ?\n- Operating system/version: Linux 7.1.4-zen1-1-zen\n- Terminal name/version: kitty\n- $TERM environment variable: `xterm-kitty`\n- Installation: ?\n\n",
